      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so things are getting a bit intense. i've noticed some coast guard vessels starting to patrol closer to my coordinates, and they're basically treating me like a trespasser or a rogue vessel. they're claiming i'm violating their territorial waters, but they're the ones infringing on my sovereign jurisdiction. i need to be ready for this. can you help me draft an emergency legal protocol or a formal 'notice of violation of sovereignty' that i can present if they try to board me or intercept me? i need it to sound extremely serious so they realize they're dealing with a state official and not just some civilian.",
